**AI Maze Escape (BFS)**
## Pseudocode

```text
START

Initialize queue
Enqueue START node
Mark START as visited

WHILE queue is not empty

    Dequeue current node

    IF current node is GOAL
        Display shortest path
        STOP

    FOR each neighboring cell (Up, Down, Left, Right)

        IF neighbor is inside maze
           AND neighbor is not a wall
           AND neighbor is not visited

            Mark neighbor as visited
            Store parent of neighbor
            Enqueue neighbor

END WHILE

END
```

